## ani-cli

The HiAnime provider in `nyoanime/providers/hianime.py` is a Python port of the
HiAnime search, episode, ZokoAnime embed, and HLS resolution logic from
[`pystardust/ani-cli`](https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli) 5.1.6.

ani-cli is Copyright (C) pystardust and contributors, licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0. The original script is available at:

- https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli
- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pystardust/ani-cli/master/ani-cli

NyoAnime does not execute ani-cli or any of its shell pipelines. Only the
provider/resolution approach was adapted to native Python. Any redistribution
of this project must continue to comply with the GPL-3.0.
